AGENTS.md
# CLAUDE.md stays in the context: the test stage reads it (tests/Unit/Repo).
# The vendor stage removes it, so it never reaches the runtime image.
# The documentation website is built and checked by its own workflow; the
# image needs none of it (and its node_modules would bloat the context).
website
